["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">珍しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めずらしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">罕见的；稀奇的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>雪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのは<ruby>珍<rp>(</rp><rt>めずら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个城市下雪很少见。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目立つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めだつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">显眼；引人注目；突出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215065\">スーツを<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>目立<rp>(</rp><rt>めだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他穿西装很显眼</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">めちゃくちゃ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒唐；不合理；无稽；荒谬；语无伦次；极端；毫无道理；鲁莽；任意妄为；混乱；杂乱；混淆；凌乱；非常；真的；特别；超级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"11029378\">めちゃくちゃアホくさいミスでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个非常愚蠢的错误。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">めっきり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">显著地；明显地；明白地；相当地；大为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194625\">めっきり<ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它变得明显寒冷。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メッセージ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">消息；信息；讯息</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223117\">このメッセージは<ruby>意味<rp>(</rp><rt>いみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をなさない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这条信息没道理</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">滅多に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めったに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">很少；难得；罕见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172911\"><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はめったに<ruby>映画<rp>(</rp><rt>えいが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">现在我很少去看电影了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目付き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めつき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><spa