ss=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他真是个完美的白痴</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メニュー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（餐馆的）菜单；菜谱；日程；计划；节目；课程；服务项目；（计算机）菜单；选单</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194316\">もう<ruby>一度<rp>(</rp><rt>いちど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>メニューを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せていただけますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能再给我一份菜单吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">めまい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">眩晕；头晕；晕眩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"157526\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>空腹<rp>(</rp><rt>くうふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でめまいがした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">因为太饿，我头晕眼花。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13972565\" title=\"Tatoeba · Rinrin\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Rinrin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メモ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笔记；备忘录</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"114596\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつもメモを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ながら<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他总是用笔记说话</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目盛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めもり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刻度；分度；刻线；标度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目安</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めやす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">标准；准则；衡量标准；参照；粗略估计；近似值</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メロディー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旋律；曲调</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223115\">このメロディーは<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>日本人<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个旋律是许多日本人所熟悉的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">綿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">棉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219459\">この<ruby>綿<rp>(</rp><rt>めん</rt><rp>)</