n class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">免除</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めんじょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">免除</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">免</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">面する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めんする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">面向；朝向</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">面積</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めんせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">面积；地面面积；占地面积</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220369\">この<ruby>都市<rp>(</rp><rt>とし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>面積<rp>(</rp><rt>めんせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどれくらいか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个城市是什么地方?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">面接</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めんせつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">面试</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196530\">ホームステイをするにはスポンサーの<ruby>面接<rp>(</rp><rt>めんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けなくてはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为了获得家庭居留资格,您必须接受赞助人的采访。</span></div></li