g=\"ja\">メートル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">米（长度单位）；计量器；仪表</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">已经；还；到现在；现在；（不）再；（不）了；很快；马上；不久；随即；更；更多；又；另外；另一个；哎呀；天哪；真是的；拜托；该死；真是够了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74910\">もう～、なにやってんだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">天啊,你这是在干嘛?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もう一度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もういちど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">再一次；又一遍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194309\">もう<ruby>一度<rp>(</rp><rt>いちど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ゆっくりお<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能慢慢重复一遍吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">儲かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">获利；盈利；赚钱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210424\">その<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しはお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>儲<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かったかい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你从那生意赚到钱了吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">儲ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">获利；赚钱；获得；盈利；生育；生孩子；走运；碰上好运</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"635434\">ここに<ruby>先物取引<rp>(</rp><rt>さきものとりひき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>儲<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いらっしゃいますか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这里有人从期货交易中获利吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">設ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">准备；提供；设置；建立；组织；制定（规则）；找（借口）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229240\">イギリスは<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>植民地<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくみんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>設<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">英国建立了许多殖民地。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し上げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうしあげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">说；告诉；陈述；表达；献（祝贺等）；做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226522\">お<ruby>礼<rp>(</rp><rt>れい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げようもありません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我永远感激不尽</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し入れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうしいれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">提议；建议</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し込み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうしこみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">申请；报名；请求；订阅；要约；提议；初步接触；挑战</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92674\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすべての<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みを<ruby>断<rp>(</rp><rt>ことわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她拒绝了所有的求婚</span></div></li>"]